<title>HONG KONG: Malaysia's YTL shows interest in HK's CEPA stake.</title>
<headline>Malaysia's YTL shows interest in HK's CEPA stake.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Consolidated Electric Power Asia Ltd (CEPA) said on Friday that it had been approached by YTL Corp Bhd about the possible acquisition of a controlling interest in the power company.</p>
<p>But it said that no offer or formal proposal had been received from YTL.</p>
</text>
